## 2. `vendor-tier-caps.ts` — no schema change; add a derived helper

No `TierCaps` field changes (the Enterprise signal already exists as `slotsPerDay === Infinity`). Add a named predicate next to the existing exports for symmetry and to keep the gate in one place:

```ts
// apps/web/lib/vendor-tier-caps.ts (append)
/** Tier #3: only Enterprise (unbounded slots/day) may plot time-bound slots. */
export function canPlotTimeSlots(tier: VendorTier): boolean {
  return tierCaps(tier).slotsPerDay === Infinity;
}
```

