## 3. Type / select changes

**`apps/web/app/dashboard/[eventId]/vendors/actions.ts`** — extend the `targetVendor` select (line 391) is **not** needed (it already pulls `service_id`). No type change to the select. The slot id is acquired via RPC, so no extra column read on `targetVendor`.

