**File:** `apps/web/app/vendor-dashboard/services/page.tsx`.

1. **Signal** (near line 80, beside `slotsCap`):
   ```ts
   const canPlotSlots = canPlotTimeSlots(asVendorTier(tier)); // slotsPerDay === Infinity
   ```
2. **Data fetch** (near the `tier_state` read at lines 66-76): one query for all active slots for this vendor, bucketed `slotsByService` keyed on `vendor_service_id`.
